# nonbasic land, refused) and reveals nothing; the library is shuffled all the same and the Guide stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Campus Guide
Plains x4
Tropical Island
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
